Table: Adjusted Cox model with treatment x biomarker interaction.

|term                               |   HR|95% CI      | p-value|
|:----------------------------------|----:|:-----------|-------:|
|treatmentLev+5FU                   | 0.67|0.50 – 0.90 | 0.00744|
|biomarkerPositive                  | 1.01|0.73 – 1.38 | 0.96200|
|age                                | 1.00|0.99 – 1.01 | 0.92700|
|sexMale                            | 0.87|0.69 – 1.10 | 0.23500|
|nodes                              | 1.11|1.09 – 1.14 | 0.00000|
|treatmentLev+5FU:biomarkerPositive | 0.97|0.59 – 1.59 | 0.89200|


:::
